  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "Independently derived cubic pair: y=x^3 is increasing through (-1,-1),(0,0),(1,1); y=-x^3 is its x-axis reflection. x unit 72 and y unit 40 canvas units. Finite window x in [-1.5,1.5], not a domain restriction.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-s2-n37",
        "exercise": "794",
        "text": "794. 画出下列各函数的大致图像，并指出函数递增和递减时自变量取值的集合：\na) $y=x^3$；\nb) $y=-x^3$。"
      }
    ],
